@segment  climb-f10-f12
@title    Climb — Focus 10 to Focus 12
@levels   F12
@fixed
@verbosity 3
@duration ~1m30s

say Now, from Focus 10, you will move into a different state of consciousness. That state is called Focus 12.
pause 4
say Focus 12. Where your awareness moves far beyond the limits of your physical body. Far beyond physical perception.
pause 5
say To reach Focus 12, all you need do is count slowly in your mind from ten to twelve. When you reach the number twelve, you will be in Focus 12. A state of expanded awareness.
pause 4
say Let me guide you.
pause 3
level F12
say Ten.
pause 4
say Eleven. Your awareness is expanding, reaching outward, more and more.
pause 5
say Twelve.
pause 6
